(16980,0,0,'Intruders have breached the inner sanctum. Hasten the destruction of the green dragon! Leave only bones and sinew for the reanimation!',14,0,0,0,0,17251,'The Lich King - Valithria Dreamwalker - SAY_LICH_KING_INTRO'),
